{"seq":1,"slug":"loot-economy","title":"掉落与经济平衡：作为水龙头的战利品","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/loot-economy","wordCount":1576,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"掉落与经济平衡-作为水龙头的战利品\">掉落与经济平衡：作为水龙头的战利品</h1><p>《暗黑破坏神 III》上线时的拍卖行灾难，根源不是拍卖行本身，而是掉落——过高的金币和装备产出让虚拟经济在几周内恶性通胀，一件顶级装备的价格从几百万飙到数十亿金币。掉落表是游戏经济里最主要的<strong>水龙头</strong>（faucet，货币和物品流入的源头），拧得太松，整个经济就会淹没。这一篇把掉落放进经济系统的宏观视角，讲清它如何驱动通胀、如何用期望产出估算长期压力、以及它与 power creep 的纠缠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-水龙头与水槽\">核心概念：水龙头与水槽</h2><p>游戏经济学把货币/物品的流动抽象成两端：<strong>水龙头</strong>（faucet）产出，<strong>水槽</strong>（sink）回收。掉落是最大的水龙头之一；修理费、交易税、消耗品、装备升级材料消耗是常见的水槽。经济健康的前提是长期看产出与回收大致平衡：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>净流入速率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>产出速率</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>回收速率</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{净流入速率} = \\text{产出速率} - \\text{回收速率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净流入速率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产出速率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">回收速率</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若净流入长期为正，货币越来越多、单位货币购买力下降，就是<strong>通胀</strong>；若长期为负，货币枯竭、新玩家寸步难行，就是<strong>通缩</strong>。掉落表调的是水龙头这一端。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[掉落表&lt;br/&gt;主要水龙头] --&gt; B[货币·物品流入经济]&#10;  C[击杀·开箱·任务] --&gt; A&#10;  B --&gt; D[玩家持有的财富池]&#10;  D --&gt; E[水槽:修理·税·消耗·升级]&#10;  E --&gt; F[货币·物品被销毁]&#10;  D --&gt; G{净流入 &gt; 0 长期?}&#10;  G --&gt;|是| H[通胀:购买力下降]&#10;  G --&gt;|否| I[通缩:新玩家困难]\">flowchart TD\n  A[掉落表&lt;br/&gt;主要水龙头] --&gt; B[货币·物品流入经济]\n  C[击杀·开箱·任务] --&gt; A\n  B --&gt; D[玩家持有的财富池]\n  D --&gt; E[水槽:修理·税·消耗·升级]\n  E --&gt; F[货币·物品被销毁]\n  D --&gt; G{净流入 &gt; 0 长期?}\n  G --&gt;|是| H[通胀:购买力下降]\n  G --&gt;|否| I[通缩:新玩家困难]</pre><p>掉落系统的经济职责，就是让 A→B 这条水龙头的流量，与 E→F 的水槽流量在设计意图内匹配。这里只讲掉落这一端；水槽的设计、通胀通缩的完整理论、交易市场机制，深水区在<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink\">经济与平衡 hub</a>，本篇不越界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"期望产出-从掉率反推经济压力\">期望产出：从掉率反推经济压力</h2><p>评估一张掉落表对经济的影响，核心工具是<strong>期望产出</strong>（expected yield）。给定一张掉落表，单次触发的期望货币产出是各条目产出乘以概率之和：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mtext>产出</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E[\\text{产出}] = \\sum_i p_i \\cdot v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">产出</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是条目 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 的掉率、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是其价值（货币量或折算价值）。再乘以「玩家单位时间的触发次数」，就得到每个玩家每小时向经济注入的财富速率。</p>\n<p>举例：一张怪物掉落表期望产出 50 金币，玩家每小时能杀 200 只怪，则单玩家每小时注入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">50 \\times 200 = 10000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span></span></span></span></span> 金币。若在线玩家 10 万、平均每天在线 2 小时，则经济每天净注入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>100000</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10000 \\times 2 \\times 100000 = 2 \\times 10^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100000</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 金币。这个数字必须和水槽的回收能力对齐，否则通胀不可避免。下表展示掉落设计参数如何直接放大经济压力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>保守配置</th>\n<th>激进配置</th>\n<th>对通胀的影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单次期望金币</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>线性放大产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每小时击杀数</td>\n<td>100</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>线性放大产出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀有物掉率</td>\n<td>0.01%</td>\n<td>0.5%</td>\n<td>高价值物贬值加速</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>有效水槽比例</td>\n<td>90%</td>\n<td>40%</td>\n<td>决定净流入正负</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>关键洞见：稀有物品的掉率对经济的影响是<strong>非线性</strong>的。稀有装备的价值来自稀缺，掉率翻 50 倍不只是产出翻 50 倍，而是让「稀有」这个属性本身崩塌——原本值百万的装备变得人手一件，价值归零。这也是<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a>里强调「防稀释」的经济根源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"power-creep-与掉落的军备竞赛\">Power Creep 与掉落的军备竞赛</h2><p><strong>power creep</strong>（数值膨胀）是长期运营游戏的顽疾：新内容为了吸引玩家，属性总要比旧内容强一点，久而久之数值指数级膨胀，旧内容彻底作废。掉落表是 power creep 的直接载体——每次版本更新往掉落池里塞进更强的装备，就是在给军备竞赛添柴。</p>\n<p>掉落设计能缓解 power creep 的手段有几种：<strong>横向掉落</strong>（新装备提供不同玩法而非单纯更高数值）、<strong>掉落回收</strong>（旧装备可分解成升级新装备的材料，给旧掉落一个退出通道）、以及<strong>掉落率随版本收紧</strong>（新神装初期极稀有，缓和其对经济的冲击）。这些手段的具体数值如何定，依赖下一篇<a href=\"drop-tuning\">掉落率调校</a>的方法论。</p>\n<p>数值膨胀的完整对策——包括属性曲线设计、数值重置（soft reset）、赛季制——属于<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/balancing-methods\">经济与平衡 hub</a> 的战斗数值范畴，本篇只讲掉落这一侧的应对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"掉落分层与经济分层的对应\">掉落分层与经济分层的对应</h2><p>一个常被忽视的设计原则：掉落的稀有度分层应当和经济的价值分层对应。理想情况下，普通掉落维持日常经济的流动性（人人都有金币花），稀有掉落承载财富的存储与炫耀功能（高价值、低流通）。若两者错位——比如普通怪频繁掉出高价值物——就会同时造成流动性泛滥（通胀）和稀有性崩塌。</p>\n<p>实现这种对应，要让掉落表的期望产出结构和目标经济结构匹配：绝大部分期望价值来自高频低价的普通掉落（保证流动性），极小部分来自低频高价的稀有掉落（保证存储价值）。用基尼系数或价值分布直方图监控掉落产出的「贫富结构」，是成熟运营团队的做法——这依赖<a href=\"../../game-telemetry-analytics/metrics/monetization-metrics\">遥测与分析</a>提供的经济指标看板。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>掉落是游戏经济最主要的水龙头，其产出速率必须与水槽回收速率长期匹配，否则通胀或通缩。</li>\n<li>期望产出 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>∑</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E=\\sum p_i v_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 乘以触发频率，是估算掉落对经济注入速率的核心工具；稀有物掉率对经济的影响是非线性的（稀缺性崩塌）。</li>\n<li>掉落表是 power creep 的直接载体，可用横向掉落、掉落回收、掉落率随版本收紧来缓解军备竞赛。</li>\n<li>掉落的稀有度分层应与经济的价值分层对应：普通掉落供流动性、稀有掉落供存储价值，错位会同时引发通胀与稀缺崩塌。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"../sampling/rarity-tiers\">稀有度层级</a> —— 防稀释的经济根源。</li>\n<li>同 hub：<a href=\"drop-tuning\">掉落率调校</a> —— 如何把掉落率调到经济目标。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/economy/inflation-faucet-sink\">经济与平衡 · 通胀与水龙头水槽</a> —— 完整的通胀理论与水槽设计。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../game-economy-balancing/combat-balance/balancing-methods\">经济与平衡 · 平衡方法</a> —— power creep 的数值对策。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"掉落与经济平衡：作为水龙头的战利品","id":"掉落与经济平衡-作为水龙头的战利品"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：水龙头与水槽","id":"核心概念-水龙头与水槽"},{"level":2,"text":"期望产出：从掉率反推经济压力","id":"期望产出-从掉率反推经济压力"},{"level":2,"text":"Power Creep 与掉落的军备竞赛","id":"power-creep-与掉落的军备竞赛"},{"level":2,"text":"掉落分层与经济分层的对应","id":"掉落分层与经济分层的对应"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"坏运保护：从去重到个性化的运气补偿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/fairness/bad-luck-protection"},"next":{"title":"掉落率调校：从设计意图到数据验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-loot-tables-drops/practice/drop-tuning"}}